{"id": "48116", "title": "余秋雨散文精选", "author": "千秋网", "category": "文学名著", "count": 105, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/48/48116/48116s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/48/48116.htm", "intro": "长期以来，著名学者、作家余秋雨的文化大散文在受到读者极大欢迎的同时，也在文化界引起极大的关注和争议。为便于读者清晰了解余秋雨的历史、人文以及人生诉求，千秋网选编了余秋雨《文化苦旅》、《行者无疆》、《千年一叹》、《山居笔记》等作品里的精品，力求让读者能在最短的时间和最小的篇幅里，阅读到更有代表性和更经典的余秋雨散文。", "base": "files/article/html/48/48116", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "1、遥远的绝响", "file": "6517194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2、千年庭院", "file": "6517195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3、小人", "file": "6517196.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4、一个王朝的背影", "file": "6517197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5、关于友情", "file": "6517198.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6、这里真安静", "file": "6517199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7、阳关雪", "file": "6517200.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8、苏东坡突围", "file": "6517201.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9、三峡", "file": "6517202.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10、庐山", "file": "6517203.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11、上海人", "file": "6517204.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12、流放者的土地", "file": "6517205.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13、莫高窟", "file": "6517206.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14、西湖梦", "file": "6517207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15、青云谱随想", "file": "6517208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "16、乱世流浪女", "file": "6517210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17、江南小镇", "file": "6517211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18、藏书忧", "file": "6517212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19、庙宇", "file": "6517213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20、废墟", "file": "6517214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21、腊梅", "file": "6517215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22、贵池傩", "file": "6517216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23、长者", "file": "6517217.html", "available"